window.__T__=[{"i":19160,"text":"A surreal high-fashion editorial artwork where [CITY/LANDMARK] is formed entirely from flowing sound waves, audio frequencies, and rhythmic lines. The soundwaves begin as tiny vibrations at the bottom of the composition and gradually transform into the recognizable architecture of [CITY/LANDMARK].\n\nDifferent frequencies become different visual elements — thick bass waves create buildings, delicate high-frequency lines create windows and bridges, glowing pulses become streetlights and moving vehicles. Tiny fragments of typography, coordinates, music notes, and abstract symbols float through the waves.\n\nClean pale background, intense electric colors mixed with subtle metallic textures, dramatic depth, ultra-fine linework, futuristic editorial art, controlled chaos, sophisticated composition, no people, no ordinary skyline illustration, the architecture itself must visibly emerge from the soundwave pattern, striking and instantly recognizable, premium magazine cover aesthetic.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUAE6JVbQAALdzc.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUAE6JLaoAAJ6Ug.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUAE6JObQAAIIha.jpg"]},{"i":19161,"text":"超写实电影级女性人像特写，一位年轻成年女性的极近距离侧脸肖像。\n\nGpt Image 2.5断档领先啊\n\n人物采用非常精致、非现实感但真实可拍摄的人类面部结构，脸型小巧柔和，下颌线纤细流畅，鼻梁精致自然，嘴唇饱满柔软，嘴唇微微张开，露出一点点洁白牙齿。\n\n她拥有非常白皙、通透、细腻的瓷肌，真实皮肤微纹理和细微毛孔可见，但整体肌肤依然柔滑干净。皮肤受到强烈的彩色折射光照射，在额头、鼻梁、脸颊、眼周和嘴唇附近产生细腻的粉色、青色、紫色、蓝色和金色虹彩反射。\n\n人物为明显的侧脸构图，脸部朝向画面左侧，头部略微向上抬起，呈现一种仰望光线的姿态。镜头距离极近，主要呈现眼睛、鼻子、嘴唇、脸颊和下颌区域。\n\n眼睛是画面的视觉中心。\n\n拥有非常大的清澈眼睛，眼球具有高度真实的湿润感，虹膜内部呈现梦幻的多色虹彩结构，包含蓝色、紫色、青绿色、金黄色、橙色和粉红色，如同微型彩虹折射在虹膜内部。\n\n瞳孔清晰深邃，眼睛表面具有真实的湿润高光和细小反射点。长而自然的睫毛，睫毛根根分明，眼周具有柔和的粉红色和淡淡的自然血色。\n\n头发为极浅的白金色、银白色长发，柔顺细腻，发丝真实可见。头发受到彩色光线影响，在不同区域呈现淡紫色、青绿色、粉蓝色和淡金色的微妙反射。\n\n部分发丝贴近脸部，部分发丝自然垂落在脸颊和肩侧。\n\n嘴唇呈自然透明的珊瑚粉 / 玫瑰粉色，具有湿润玻璃般的光泽，唇部边缘柔和自然。\n\n背景为纯深黑色，几乎没有环境信息，让人物脸部完全从黑暗中浮现出来。\n\n采用极强的逆光与棱镜折射光效果。\n\n一道梦幻的彩虹光从侧上方进入画面，在人物脸部形成细腻的彩色光带，并在眼睛、鼻梁、脸颊、嘴唇和头发上产生彩虹色反射。\n\n整体光线具有高级时尚摄影和未来主义视觉效果。\n\n超高细节，\nphotorealistic，\ncinematic portrait photography，\nextreme close-up，\nmacro facial photography，\nrealistic skin micro-texture，\nrealistic eyelashes，\nrealistic individual hair strands，\nrealistic wet eyes，\nprismatic rainbow refraction，\nchromatic light dispersion，\niridescent reflections，\nsoft luminous skin，\nhigh dynamic range，\nshallow depth of field，\nsharp focus on eyes，\ndeep black background，\ndreamlike atmosphere，\nethereal beauty，\nluxury editorial photography，\ncinematic lighting，\n8K detail。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUAGcOXaEAA4AQC.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUAGcOZbYAAsUGN.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUAGcOmbYAALn1I.jpg"]},{"i":19162,"text":"（欢迎返图）：\n主题方向：东方禅意极简封面海报\n风格分支：高传播概念型\n主体内容：一位古风女子站在浅色台面边缘，侧身望向一道垂直落下的光带\n情绪母题：安静、治愈、轻哲思感\n场景与意象：奶白空间、琥珀色竖向光带、女子、极少远景色块、留白背景\n构图与空间：9:16竖版构图，竖向光带贯穿画面中上部形成第一视觉中心，人物位于下方偏一侧，顶部和侧边保留完整标题区\n色彩控制：象牙白作为整体高明度基底，琥珀橙只用于垂直光带和少量反光，人物服装保持浅白，局部可用极少灰蓝平衡；避免整图橙黄化\n光线与质感：清透高亮柔光，画面边缘清晰，极简现代东方海报感\n画幅比例：9:16\n补充要求：光带必须像海报主视觉一样醒目，画面要大气、极简、高识别，不要加入多余道具","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUFu6_FbAAAKKIp.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUFu6_FagAA11hD.jpg"]},{"i":19163,"text":"A full-body studio portrait of the woman standing in a wide, industrial concrete warehouse with exposed pillars and a high ceiling. The same person is positioned in the center, legs spread in a confident stance, wearing a strapless black leather bodysuit with intricate side lace-up detailing and matching over-the-knee black leather high-heeled boots with red soles. She wears long, dangling silver fringe earrings and a delicate gold necklace. The lighting is dramatic, featuring a strong, singular shaft of sunlight streaming down from a ceiling opening, creating high-contrast highlights and soft shadows on the concrete floor. The camera angle is low, looking up at the same person to emphasize height. The background is softly blurred by shallow depth of field, showing the raw texture of concrete pillars and a dusty, unfinished floor. The image has a sharp, professional editorial aesthetic with a cool, desaturated color palette, captured with a 35mm lens to maintain a clear, realistic depth of field.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUCcQR5XYAAB3L1.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUCcQsPW0AAWg0j.jpg"]},{"i":19164,"text":"（欢迎返图）：\n摄影风格：日间清亮高光CCD生活照风\n写真方向：都市休闲时尚写真\n场景方向：现代城市露天小剧场 / 白色阶梯坐席 / 浅灰舞台 / 极简遮阳结构 / 远处城市建筑\n服装方向：西柚红色修身方领短袖短上衣 + 冷白色低腰A字超短裙\n气质标签：明亮、松弛、俏皮、精致、夏日感\n五官方向：明媚清甜自然脸\n身形方向：轻盈纤细\n线条强调：强\n镜头方向：大腿及上半身\n姿态动作：从白色阶梯缓慢走下，一只手轻扶栏杆，身体侧前方看向镜头，自然微笑\n光线氛围：晴天高亮自然光 + 白色阶梯形成大面积柔亮反射补光\n滤镜效果：高亮清晰红白CCD色彩 + 白皙通透肤色 + 鲜明中间调 + 稳定黑位 + 轻颗粒\n画幅比例：9:16\n补充要求：西柚红鲜亮但不荧光；短款上衣露出腰腹和肚脐，胸线清楚但自然；白色阶梯形成明显纵深，不做舞台宣传照","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUHHiAkakAAElhx.jpg"]},{"i":19165,"text":"1\nCreate a vertical 3:4 high-fashion studio portrait, framed approximately from the waist up. Use a subtle diagonal camera angle and dynamic composition, placing the subject centrally with a slight shift toward the right while her body remains naturally turned toward the camera.\n\nBACKGROUND:\nUse a completely saturated deep-red studio backdrop with a rough grainy surface. Add authentic analog film texture and subtle vintage noise, creating the visual feel of a retro magazine cover or underground music poster.\n\nSUBJECT:\nUse the woman in the provided reference image as the exact visual subject. Maintain her recognizable facial identity, facial structure, hairstyle, skin tone, age, natural proportions, and overall appearance. Do not alter her defining features.\n\nHer expression should feel calm, mysterious, confident, and slightly distant. Her eyes are partially hidden behind slim dark vintage sunglasses.\n\nPOSE:\nPlace her in a relaxed but expressive fashion-editorial pose. Her head is tilted slightly forward and toward one side, suggesting that she is deeply focused on a phone conversation.\n\nShe holds a classic vintage telephone receiver naturally against one ear with one hand, while her other hand holds the opposite part of the telephone. Keep the posture effortless, believable, cinematic, and elegant.\n\nWARDROBE:\nDress her in an oversized structured black blazer or sophisticated black jacket over a completely covered black top. Keep the styling modest and fully covered with no exposed cleavage or bare torso.\n\nAdd narrow black vintage sunglasses. The telephone should be a classic wired retro receiver with a clearly visible coiled cable connecting it to the telephone base.\n\nDETAILS:\nMake the coiled telephone cord clearly visible and physically believable. Preserve her dark slightly tousled yet well-groomed hair and natural polished appearance.\n\nUse lighting that draws attention to her face, lips, sunglasses, hands, and subtle facial details. Let the black clothing gradually blend into deep shadows.\n\nThe red backdrop should remain vivid, saturated, slightly rough, and enhanced with authentic vintage film grain.\n\nVISUAL STYLE:\nLuxury fashion-editorial photography inspired by 1980s and 1990s glossy magazines, vintage music artwork, and artistic poster photography.\n\nUse strong contrast, deep blacks, dramatic studio illumination, pronounced analog grain, subtle film imperfections, and a retro-futuristic editorial aesthetic.\n\nMOOD:\nMysterious, bold, elegant, stylish, cinematic, and subtly secretive. The final image should feel like an enigmatic vintage phone-conversation scene from a fashion campaign or music poster.\n\nQUALITY:\nPhotorealistic, highly detailed, premium editorial photography, realistic skin texture, accurate anatomy, natural hands, sharp facial details, crisp sunglasses and telephone receiver, deep shadows, rich saturated red tones, authentic analog film texture, strong visual depth, and polished 8K-quality detail.\n\nIMPORTANT:\nPreserve the original reference subject and intended composition. Do not introduce unnecessary objects, characters, colors, wardrobe changes, or major pose changes. The final visual should closely match the described concept while maintaining a natural photographic appearance.\n\nPrompt2\nUse the woman from the reference image as the exact subject. Preserve her facial identity, facial structure, age, skin tone, hairstyle, and natural proportions.\n\nCreate a 3:4 vertical surreal fashion editorial portrait on a completely saturated grainy red background.\n\nThe woman stands calmly in the center wearing an oversized black blazer and fully covered black top with narrow black sunglasses.\n\nAround her, several vintage telephone receivers and coiled cords appear to float in mid-air at different depths. She holds one receiver naturally against her ear while the other floating receivers create a visual spiral around her.\n\nKeep the composition elegant rather than chaotic. Use dramatic diagonal perspective, deep shadows, sharp facial focus, realistic hands, physically believable floating objects, strong red-and-black contrast.\n\nVintage 1990s magazine cover, underground music poster, analog film grain, cinematic studio lighting, premium photorealistic fashion photography, 8K.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUBLLGna0AApfpm.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUBLLLbaYAAbGry.jpg"]},{"i":19166,"text":"VisionQuest Cinematic Prism Spectrum Style Portrait.\n\n[ Portrait Series - Part 6 ]\n\nPrompt:\n\n{\n  \"input\": {\n    \"subject_name\": \"{{NAME}}\"\n  },\n  \"prompt_template\": \"Tight headshot of {{NAME}}, with a face and likeness that exactly replicate the attached reference photo, captured mid head-turn, strands of hair swaying naturally with the movement, spectrum-colored prism streaks flowing outward from the head and shoulders, crisp hard-edged light striking the face, solid black backdrop, bright vivid cinematic streaks of motion, hyper-realistic skin with visible texture, deep dramatic shadow contrast, film-style frozen-moment-with-blur look, rich fine detail, 4K --ar 4:5 --raw --stylize 50\",\n  \"style\": {\n    \"shot_type\": \"tight headshot\",\n    \"subject\": {\n      \"name\": \"{{NAME}}\",\n      \"gender\": \"male\",\n      \"identity\": \"exact likeness of the attached reference photo\",\n      \"skin\": \"hyper-realistic, visible texture\"\n    },\n    \"motion\": {\n      \"action\": \"captured mid head-turn\",\n      \"hair\": \"strands swaying naturally with the movement\",\n      \"effect\": \"film-style frozen-moment-with-blur look\"\n    },\n    \"light_trails\": {\n      \"type\": \"spectrum-colored prism streaks\",\n      \"origin\": \"flowing outward from head and shoulders\",\n      \"look\": \"bright, vivid cinematic streaks of motion\"\n    },\n    \"lighting\": {\n      \"key\": \"crisp hard-edged light striking the face\",\n      \"shadows\": \"deep, high-contrast\"\n    },\n    \"background\": \"solid black backdrop\",\n    \"quality\": {\n      \"detail\": \"rich fine detail\",\n      \"resolution\": \"4K\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"parameters\": {\n    \"aspect_ratio\": \"4:5\",\n    \"raw\": true,\n    \"stylize\": 50,\n    \"reference_image\": \"required\"\n  }\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUB3HhubQAEdIzQ.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUB3Hh8a4AA7nkc.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUB3HhtacAANj34.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUB3Hh0a8AA6sjJ.jpg"]},{"i":19167,"text":"Oil painting style, thick impasto texture with visible palette knife strokes. A serene lake at dusk with a large golden moon partially hidden behind textured grey clouds. Six black swans swimming gracefully on the water, creating gentle ripples. Golden moonlight reflecting on the water surface. Pink cherry blossom tree on the right shore with petals falling slowly. Small cozy house with warm yellow lights in the windows. Dry golden reeds swaying gently in the breeze. Mountains in the distance. Calm, peaceful atmosphere, cinematic lighting, 4k.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUCbsxIXMAApy7d.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUCbpgSWcAAOttF.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2107855627577954304/img/nCeCZlU3V0HlMdOw.jpg"]},{"i":19168,"text":"的理解上完全能扛大旗，费率还更低（$0.134/$0.0336 ≈ 4 倍）。\n图 1 是密集图文的 case 实验，2K 档即可稳定输出。而 AI Studio 还能出 4K，ChatGPT 似乎固定1K .……\n\n对于版权限制：NB 家族的 IP 支持整体宽松，NB 2 开始，才限制绘制漫威和部分迪士尼 IP。在个人用途上，以低挫败感和高可玩性吊打 gpt-image。\n相应的，商用风险需要自行解决。\n \n画面方面：会留白是 NB 家族的显著优势。gpt-image 截至最新的 2.5 版本，扩散不充分感、在应该留白的地方竭力复制元素的毛病丝毫未改。\n图 2 右侧可以看到同一组 prompt 在 gpt-image-2.5 的绘制效果。\n\n参数上：NB 2.1 延续了 NB 2 既可以 Web Ground，又可以 Image Search 的组合，超出预训练知识的任务不会陷入死局。gpt-image 就不那么省心了，你只能通过上传参考图的方式来打补丁。\n另外，NB 2 家族都可以同时输出图文，边画边聊，干掉了切换文字大模型的折腾工作。\n图 3 的文本接上 tts，可以无缝处理成有声书。\n\n文字美学：NB 2.1 的标题字体，尤其是中文衬线字体，长进有限，打不过上一代的 gpt-image-2。如果你的绘制任务涉及文字设计，NB 还不是直出的好选择，期待新版  Pro 能有突破。\n图 4 为 NB 2.1 出品的宋体，装饰感，0！","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUCSeGybIAAKvzh.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUCSeGuawAAOFTl.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUCStgOaYAEYC_f.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2107845936030568448/img/D-17oVDVd6x6DwJJ.jpg"]},{"i":19169,"text":"this AI character stole another AI character's viral video.\n\n3 days later. same clip.\nthe copy got 25.7M views. the original got 20M.\n\nmeet dahab daddy. 9 days old. 222,000 followers. 106M views.\n\nhe has never been filmed. not once.\n\nand he's not alone. 53 characters like him pulled 1.68 BILLION views in 3 weeks.\n\nhere's where the money is:\n\n- brand deals: his bio already has a brand contact\n- AI Invasion: $1 per 1,000 views, up to $2,000 per video, from a $1,000,000 pool\n- Higgsfield Earn: up to $2,500 per video\n- affiliate: up to 25% of every subscription you refer\n- merch or your own guide\n\none 10-sec video costs $0.50–$9.68 to make.\n\nhere's the exact step by step 👇\n\nSTEP 1: the concept\none exaggerated feature that reads as a silhouette. one outfit in one color. a prim look doing street stuff.\ndahab = bald top + long curls on the sides + horseshoe mustache + purple 70s leather jacket.\n\npaste this into chatgpt or claude:\n\n\"pitch me 10 original characters for short-form video. each one: a name, a one-line vibe, ONE exaggerated hairstyle readable at thumbnail size, ONE standout facial feature, an old-fashioned outfit in one dominant color, a signature move or catchphrase. deadpan, dorky, never mean. no real people, no existing characters.\"\n\nSTEP 2: the base photo\npaste this into nano banana or gpt-image:\n\n\"ultra-photorealistic full-body studio portrait of [character], facing the camera, deadpan. plain light-grey seamless backdrop, soft even light. 85mm, f/8, head to toe in frame. natural skin texture, individual hair strands, real fabric. no text.\"\n\nwant to change something? never regenerate. edit:\n\n\"keep this exact person identical. same face, hair, body, outfit, lighting. change only: [one thing].\"\n\nSTEP 3: the character sheet\n\n\"character reference sheet of the exact same person from the image. one wide image, light-grey background in every panel. top row: 5 full-body views (front, 3/4 front, side, 3/4 back, back). bottom row: 3 close-ups (front deadpan, 3/4, signature expression). face, hair and outfit identical in every panel. thin white dividers, no text.\"\n\nSTEP 4: pick the source video\nthis step decides the views. the source needs:\n→ 1 person, 0–1 cuts, under 30 sec\n→ an everyday place + real people reacting (banquet, bar, metro)\n→ the person big in frame, facing the camera\n→ posted in the last week\n\nskip: pro sports, studios, cinematic shots, kids, politics\n\nSTEP 5: the swap\nupload the clip + your sheet to Genjutsu, Seedance 2.5 or Kling:\n\n\"character swap edit of @ video1. replace the person in @ video1 with the character from @ image1. use @ image1 for identity only. keep everything else the same: motion, camera movement, framing, background, lighting, color grading, audio and length.\"\n\nface blending with the original? blur the original face before you upload. the model can't copy what it can't see.\ndraft in 480p. render 1080p only for the take you keep.\n\nSTEP 6: posting (the first 72 hours decide everything)\n→ character on screen from frame 0\n→ 10–15 sec, no text on the video\n→ keep the ORIGINAL sound\n→ caption under 25 characters, first person, zero hashtags\n→ post on tiktok AND instagram. the same clip did 15.3M on one and 179k on the other\n→ the best video usually lands on day 2. after that growth halves every ~3 days\n\nSTEP 7: the universe\n→ repeat the winning situation, not the location\n→ crossovers with other characters. that's where smaller ones hit their best numbers\n→ milestone gags. \"100K\" posts become hits on their own\n\nthe internet is about to be full of people who don't exist.\nthe ones who post first get paid.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUCoLnRWUAAiD-X.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2107867568769798145/img/JHPHDwPoA59CyfF4.jpg"]},{"i":19170,"text":"Create a 30-second ultra-realistic cinematic live-action sequence featuring an adult man and an adult woman in a cozy pink bedroom at night.\n\nCHARACTERS:\nAn adult man in his mid-20s with messy light-brown hair, youthful-looking but clearly adult features, dark expressive eyes, a slim athletic build, wearing a plain white T-shirt and blue jeans.\n\nAn adult woman in her mid-20s with long dark hair, clearly adult features, wearing a beige short-sleeve T-shirt over a dark long-sleeve top and pink plaid pajama pants, with a small pink hair roller in her fringe.\n\nKeep both characters visually consistent throughout the entire sequence.\n\nSETTING:\nA cozy pink bedroom with an ornate white bed, pink bedding, wooden door, large curtained window, vanity with mirror and pink chair, decorative dollhouse, floor lamp, wall shelves and subtle everyday floor clutter. Keep the room layout and furniture positions consistent throughout.\n\n[0–7s]\nThe adult man carefully carries the adult woman across the bedroom in a gentle bridal-style hold. She is relaxed and comfortable, resting peacefully against him. Her arms and legs move naturally with his walking motion and her hair shifts subtly with each step. He walks slowly toward the bed while maintaining a careful, supportive posture. The camera follows naturally with gentle handheld movement.\n\n[7–14s]\nHard cut to an angle near the head of the bed. He carefully lowers her onto the mattress. Her shoulders and head settle naturally into the pillow as the mattress compresses beneath her weight. Her hair spreads naturally across the pillow. She relaxes comfortably while he adjusts the pillow and makes sure she is settled.\n\n[14–22s]\nHard cut to a wider three-quarter view. He gently pulls the pink blanket over her and adjusts it around her shoulders. He pauses beside the bed for a moment, then reaches toward the floor lamp and switches it off. The warm practical light gradually disappears, leaving soft cool blue nighttime illumination from the curtained window.\n\n[22–30s]\nHard cut to a low angle at the foot of the bed. The woman rests peacefully beneath the pink blanket. The man lowers himself onto the floor beside the bed, maintaining personal space. He rests his head lightly against the mattress edge, closes his eyes and gradually falls asleep there. He remains on the floor and never climbs onto the bed.\n\nCAMERA:\nNatural cinematic handheld camera movement. Gentle follow during the carry, controlled camera movement during the bedroom actions, and a low stable final composition. Four distinct shots with hard cuts around 7s, 14s and 22s.\n\nPHYSICS:\nRealistic human movement and weight. Natural walking, realistic body positioning, hair movement, clothing movement, mattress compression, pillow deformation, blanket folds and grounded footsteps.\n\nLIGHTING:\nWarm practical bedroom lighting during the first part. After the lamp is switched off, transition naturally into soft cool blue nighttime light coming through the curtains. Keep both characters clearly visible and realistically exposed.\n\nAUDIO:\nNatural room ambience only: footsteps, fabric movement, mattress compression, blanket rustling, lamp-switch click and quiet nighttime ambience. No dialogue, no music, no subtitles.\n\nIMPORTANT:\nBoth characters are adults. Keep their appearance, clothing, proportions and identity consistent throughout the sequence. Keep the bedroom layout consistent. The tone is gentle, wholesome and caring, with no sexual content, nudity or suggestive behavior.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2107895696821284864/img/s0_gwQ2gwNf0X878.jpg"]},{"i":19171,"text":"{\n\"subject\": {\n\"description\": \"A young adult woman taking a close-up indoor selfie, styled in a playful pastel fantasy/cosplay-inspired fashion. She faces the camera directly with a composed, slightly serious expression while posing with one hand near her face and the other holding a clothing strap.\",\n\"mirror_rules\": \"Direct front-facing selfie perspective. Preserve the natural asymmetry of the original pose and the slightly casual smartphone-camera feel. Keep the face, hairstyle, accessories, clothing proportions, and hand positions visually consistent.\",\n\"age\": \"young adult\",\n\"expression\": {\n\"eyes\": {\n\"look\": \"directly into the camera\",\n\"energy\": \"calm, confident, slightly cool and observant\",\n\"direction\": \"straight toward the lens\"\n},\n\"mouth\": {\n\"position\": \"closed with a subtle relaxed pout\",\n\"energy\": \"quiet, restrained\"\n},\n\"overall\": \"Composed and slightly aloof, with a playful cosplay character energy rather than an exaggerated smile.\"\n},\n\"face\": {\n\"preserve_original\": true,\n\"makeup\": \"Soft doll-like makeup with pale luminous skin, subtle pink blush, defined dark upper eyeliner, softly emphasized lower eyes, natural pink lips, and enlarged-looking eyes. Keep the facial proportions realistic rather than transforming the face into an illustration.\"\n}\n},\n\"hair\": {\n\"color\": \"very pale mint-blonde with a soft greenish platinum tint\",\n\"style\": \"Long, softly layered hair with straight full bangs, loose strands framing the face, and slightly curled or naturally separated ends.\",\n\"effect\": \"Fine silky strands with a smooth synthetic-wig-like sheen, lightly voluminous around the sides, with subtle flyaway hairs for realism.\"\n},\n\"body\": {\n\"frame\": \"Slim young adult feminine frame, shown from approximately mid-thigh upward in a close vertical selfie composition.\",\n\"waist\": \"Slender waist subtly defined by the fitted costume.\",\n\"chest\": \"Natural adult proportions, partially covered by the fitted white costume and pink underlayer.\",\n\"legs\": \"Mostly outside the crop, with only the upper body and a small portion of the lower silhouette visible.\",\n\"skin\": {\n\"visible_areas\": [\n\"face\",\n\"neck\",\n\"shoulders\",\n\"upper chest\",\n\"arms\",\n\"hands\"\n],\n\"tone\": \"Very fair, pale neutral skin with a soft pink undertone.\",\n\"texture\": \"Smooth but realistically human, with faint pores, subtle tonal variation, and natural softness rather than plastic-perfect skin.\",\n\"lighting_effect\": \"Soft indoor frontal illumination creates gentle highlights across the forehead, nose, cheeks, collarbones, and hands, with mild shadow under the chin and around the hairline.\"\n}\n},\n\"pose\": {\n\"position\": \"Standing close to the camera in an indoor room, centered slightly to the right.\",\n\"base\": \"Upper body turned only slightly while maintaining a mostly frontal orientation.\",\n\"overall\": \"One arm is raised horizontally with the hand posed beside the face in a casual framing gesture; the other hand grips the red-and-white shoulder strap near the chest. The pose feels deliberately styled but still like a spontaneous selfie.\"\n},\n\"clothing\": {\n\"top\": {\n\"type\": \"Fitted white fantasy/cosplay bodysuit or sleeveless top layered over a pink camisole-like underlayer\",\n\"color\": \"white with pastel pink accents and red straps\",\n\"details\": \"White base garment with pink edging around the neckline, colorful cartoon-style printed graphics across the torso, broad red-and-white backpack-like shoulder straps, and small decorative graphic elements.\",\n\"effect\": \"Clean, playful, youthful street-cosplay aesthetic with slightly glossy synthetic fabric and soft fitted tension across the torso.\"\n},\n\"bottom\": {\n\"type\": \"Fitted continuation of the costume\",\n\"color\": \"white with pink edging\",\n\"details\": \"Only the upper portion is visible near the lower crop.\"\n}\n},\n\"accessories\": {\n\"headwear\": \"Large white heart-shaped sunglasses worn on top of the head, with oversized dark lenses, plus a green pointed decorative element behind the hair.\",\n\"jewelry\": \"Minimal visible jewelry; no prominent conventional jewelry.\",\n\"device\": \"Smartphone used for the selfie, positioned just outside or close to the camera viewpoint.\",\n\"prop\": \"Red-and-white backpack-style costume straps and small graphic decorations integrated into the outfit.\"\n},\n\"photography\": {\n\"camera_style\": \"Casual smartphone front-camera selfie with a modern phone, close working distance and mild wide-angle perspective.\",\n\"angle\": \"Eye-level to slightly elevated camera angle, looking almost directly at the subject.\",\n\"shot_type\": \"Close-up to medium portrait selfie, cropped around the upper thighs.\",\n\"aspect_ratio\": \"Approximately 4:5 vertical.\",\n\"texture\": \"Natural smartphone image texture, moderate digital sharpening, clean but not overly polished skin rendering, subtle compression and realistic indoor color response.\",\n\"lighting\": \"Soft diffuse indoor ambient light coming mainly from the front and upper side, producing gentle facial illumination with mild shadow around the hair and clothing. Avoid dramatic studio lighting.\",\n\"depth_of_field\": \"Moderate smartphone depth of field, with the subject sharply readable while the room remains recognizable and only mildly softened.\"\n},\n\"background\": {\n\"setting\": \"Casual modern indoor room or bedroom with a lived-in cosplay/selfie environment.\",\n\"wall_color\": \"Light cool gray and off-white.\",\n\"elements\": [\n\"light-colored interior walls\",\n\"doorway or open room area\",\n\"dark rectangular object behind the subject\",\n\"visible floor\",\n\"simple household furnishings\"\n],\n\"atmosphere\": \"Quiet, casual, personal, slightly playful, like an everyday cosplay selfie taken at home.\",\n\"lighting\": \"Even indoor ambient illumination with no obvious theatrical lighting.\"\n},\n\"the_vibe\": {\n\"energy\": \"Quiet confidence with playful cosplay character energy.\",\n\"mood\": \"Cool, cute, slightly mysterious, controlled.\",\n\"aesthetic\": \"Pastel cyber-cute cosplay, soft fantasy fashion, contemporary Japanese-inspired character styling, casual smartphone portrait.\",\n\"authenticity\": \"Keep realistic human skin, small hair irregularities, natural hand anatomy, imperfect fabric folds, and ordinary indoor surroundings. Avoid an excessively polished commercial-cosplay look.\",\n\"intimacy\": \"Close and personal because of the direct selfie framing and proximity to the lens.\",\n\"story\": \"It feels like a casual moment before or after getting dressed for a character-themed outing, captured privately in a bedroom or dressing space.\",\n\"caption_energy\": \"quiet character reveal, playful but understated, 'just trying the look on' energy.\"\n},\n\"constraints\": {\n\"must_keep\": [\n\"pale mint-blonde hair\",\n\"straight full bangs\",\n\"long layered hair framing the face\",\n\"oversized white heart-shaped sunglasses\",\n\"green decorative head element\",\n\"direct eye contact\",\n\"calm closed-mouth expression\",\n\"one hand posed beside the face\",\n\"other hand holding the red shoulder strap\",\n\"white and pink fitted costume\",\n\"red-and-white straps\",\n\"colorful cartoon graphics on the outfit\",\n\"very fair natural skin tone\",\n\"realistic human facial proportions\",\n\"casual indoor smartphone selfie aesthetic\",\n\"vertical close portrait composition\"\n],\n\"avoid\": [\n\"anime face\",\n\"plastic skin\",\n\"exaggerated body proportions\",\n\"overly sexualized styling\",\n\"perfect studio lighting\",\n\"extreme beauty retouching\",\n\"distorted hands\",\n\"extra fingers\",\n\"warped sunglasses\",\n\"incorrect strap placement\",\n\"oversaturated colors\",\n\"unrealistic hair texture\",\n\"identity-changing facial reconstruction\"\n]\n},\n\"negative_prompt\": [\n\"anime face\",\n\"plastic skin\",\n\"over-retouched\",\n\"distorted hands\",\n\"extra fingers\",\n\"bad anatomy\",\n\"warped glasses\",\n\"oversaturated\",\n\"studio glamour\",\n\"unrealistic hair\",\n\"exaggerated proportions\",\n\"blurry face\",\n\"low detail\",\n\"identity drift\"\n]\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUEehwTXQAAXUpB.jpg"]},{"i":19172,"text":"把方括号里的内容换成你的账号名和 3–8 条最像你的帖子\n3. 头像可以附，也可以不附\n4. 片名不够像电影名就重跑，可以补一句「更毒舌」「更温柔」或「更赛博」\n\n👇 完整提示词，直接复制：\n\n请根据我的社交账号「[你的账号名]」和下面这些我发过的帖子，判断我的发帖人格，包括语气、执念、口头禅和常聊的话题，然后为我设计一张 1960 年代好莱坞复古电影海报，我是这部电影的主角。\n\n我的帖子：\n[帖子内容]\n[帖子内容]\n[帖子内容]\n\n要求：\n- 竖版 2:3\n- 片名要像一部真实上映过的电影，不要出现「AI」「艺术」这类泛泛的词\n- 从我的发帖语气里提炼一句宣传语，放在片名上方\n- 主画面是一个能代表我性格的戏剧性场景；如果附了头像，就保留我的五官，没附就用剪影或背影\n- 底部加一行仿真演职员表小字，把我常聊的话题写成「主演」「导演」的名字\n- 石版印刷颗粒、褪色纸张、手绘字体的质感\n- 不要水印\n\n避坑：\n- 片名写成「AI 艺术」就没味道了，要像电影名\n- 帖子给得太少会出一张谁都像的脸，至少给 3 条\n- 这个玩法卖的是你的性格，不是自拍\n\n你的帖子人格是哪部电影？把海报发在评论区 👇\n\n#AI绘画 #提示词 #AIart","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUFDgWQaUAA7JBj.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUFDgWSaEAAoa_E.jpg"]},{"i":19173,"text":"{\n\"task\": \"image_generation\",\n\n\"reference_image\": {\n\"role\": \"identity_reference_only\",\n\"instruction\": \"Use the uploaded reference image only to preserve the person's identity. Do not copy the reference image's original pose, clothing, lighting or background unless explicitly requested.\",\n\"identity_priority\": \"highest\"\n},\n\n\"identity_control\": {\n\"face_lock\": true,\n\"strength\": \"maximum\",\n\"preserve\": [\n\"facial geometry\",\n\"face shape\",\n\"forehead\",\n\"cheekbones\",\n\"jawline\",\n\"chin\",\n\"eye shape\",\n\"eye spacing\",\n\"eyebrow structure\",\n\"nose shape\",\n\"nose proportions\",\n\"nose tip\",\n\"nostril structure\",\n\"lip shape\",\n\"mouth proportions\",\n\"natural facial asymmetry\",\n\"skin tone\",\n\"natural skin texture\",\n\"distinctive facial characteristics\",\n\"age appearance\",\n\"recognizable identity\"\n],\n\"instruction\": \"Do not beautify, redesign, reshape or reinterpret the face. Preserve the exact recognizable person while changing only the creative elements defined below.\"\n},\n\n\"character\": {\n\"subject\": \"young adult woman\",\n\"appearance\": \"elegant, minimal, sophisticated\",\n\"expression\": \"calm, serious, emotionally restrained\",\n\"presence\": \"quiet, mysterious, confident\"\n},\n\n\"hair\": {\n\"color\": \"dark brown to near-black\",\n\"length\": \"medium to long\",\n\"texture\": \"straight, smooth and naturally fine\",\n\"parting\": \"slightly off-center side part\",\n\"style\": \"hair naturally follows the head and falls smoothly behind the shoulders\",\n\"volume\": \"controlled and moderate\",\n\"details\": [\n\"fine individual strands\",\n\"subtle highlights on illuminated sections\",\n\"natural hairline\",\n\"soft shadowed sections disappearing into the background\"\n],\n\"avoid\": [\n\"large volume\",\n\"curls\",\n\"exaggerated waves\",\n\"ornate hairstyle\"\n]\n},\n\n\"outfit\": {\n\"garment\": \"minimalist fitted long-sleeve turtleneck\",\n\"color\": \"deep black\",\n\"material\": \"soft matte fabric\",\n\"fit\": \"close natural fit\",\n\"collar\": \"high fitted turtleneck collar\",\n\"sleeves\": \"long fitted sleeves\",\n\"texture\": \"subtle fabric texture visible only where light catches it\",\n\"design\": {\n\"patterns\": false,\n\"logos\": false,\n\"text\": false,\n\"decorative_elements\": false,\n\"shiny_material\": false\n},\n\"integration\": \"The black clothing should almost merge into the black background, with only faint tonal separation defining the shoulders and upper torso.\"\n},\n\n\"accessories\": {\n\"style\": \"minimal\",\n\"earrings\": \"tiny understated stud earrings, barely visible\",\n\"necklace\": false,\n\"bracelet\": false,\n\"rings\": false,\n\"glasses\": false\n},\n\n\"makeup_and_skin\": {\n\"style\": \"minimal natural editorial makeup\",\n\"skin\": {\n\"texture\": \"realistic natural skin\",\n\"pores\": true,\n\"fine_texture\": true,\n\"beauty_filter\": false,\n\"skin_smoothing\": \"minimal\",\n\"plastic_skin\": false\n},\n\"eyebrows\": \"natural defined eyebrows\",\n\"eyes\": \"natural dark expressive eyes\",\n\"eyeliner\": \"very subtle\",\n\"eyelashes\": \"natural\",\n\"eyeshadow\": \"minimal neutral\",\n\"lips\": \"natural matte lips\",\n\"lip_definition\": \"subtle\",\n\"contouring\": \"minimal\",\n\"blush\": \"very subtle or none\"\n},\n\n\"expression\": {\n\"emotion\": \"serious, calm, mysterious\",\n\"eyes\": \"looking directly toward the camera\",\n\"lips\": \"gently closed\",\n\"smile\": false,\n\"jaw\": \"relaxed\",\n\"brows\": \"natural and relaxed\",\n\"overall_mood\": \"quiet psychological intensity\"\n},\n\n\"pose\": {\n\"type\": \"straight-on portrait\",\n\"body_position\": \"upright and centered\",\n\"head\": \"perfectly upright\",\n\"head_rotation\": \"0 degrees\",\n\"shoulders\": \"relaxed and level\",\n\"neck\": \"naturally straight\",\n\"torso\": \"facing directly toward camera\",\n\"hands\": \"outside the frame\",\n\"arms\": \"relaxed naturally below the visible frame\",\n\"movement\": \"none\",\n\"pose_priority\": \"symmetrical minimalist composition\"\n},\n\n\"environment\": {\n\"location\": \"minimalist black studio\",\n\"background\": \"almost completely black\",\n\"surface\": \"seamless dark void\",\n\"objects\": false,\n\"furniture\": false,\n\"walls_visible\": false,\n\"studio_equipment\": false,\n\"decorative_elements\": false,\n\"visual_noise\": false,\n\"negative_space\": \"extremely large\",\n\"atmosphere\": \"dark, intimate, cinematic and mysterious\"\n},\n\n\"lighting\": {\n\"style\": \"dramatic split chiaroscuro portrait lighting\",\n\"source_count\": 1,\n\"source\": \"single narrow soft directional light\",\n\"position\": \"approximately 45 degrees to the camera-right side of the subject\",\n\"height\": \"slightly above eye level\",\n\"direction\": \"side-facing directional illumination\",\n\"intensity\": \"low-key but strong enough to define one side of the face\",\n\"fill_light\": \"extremely low\",\n\"shadow_side\": \"almost completely black\",\n\"illuminated_side\": \"softly but clearly exposed\",\n\"light_transition\": \"smooth controlled transition from highlight into deep shadow\",\n\"highlight_details\": [\n\"forehead\",\n\"eyebrow ridge\",\n\"one eye\",\n\"nose bridge\",\n\"nose tip\",\n\"upper lip\",\n\"lower lip\",\n\"cheek\",\n\"jawline\",\n\"front edge of neck\"\n],\n\"hair_lighting\": \"subtle narrow highlight along illuminated hair\",\n\"rim_light\": \"none\",\n\"frontal_flash\": false,\n\"multiple_lights\": false,\n\"colored_lighting\": false\n},\n\n\"shadow_design\": {\n\"style\": \"strong half-face shadow\",\n\"left_or_opposite_face\": \"deep black shadow with minimal facial detail\",\n\"illuminated_face\": \"clean high-detail grayscale exposure\",\n\"shadow_edge\": \"soft but clearly defined\",\n\"overall_contrast\": \"high\",\n\"black_level\": \"deep\"\n},\n\n\"color_treatment\": {\n\"mode\": \"pure black and white\",\n\"monochrome\": true,\n\"deep_blacks\": true,\n\"charcoal_shadows\": true,\n\"soft_gray_midtones\": true,\n\"controlled_white_highlights\": true,\n\"contrast\": \"high\",\n\"saturation\": 0,\n\"sepia\": false,\n\"warm_tint\": false,\n\"blue_tint\": false,\n\"color_grading\": false\n},\n\n\"camera\": {\n\"type\": \"professional full-frame portrait camera\",\n\"lens\": \"85mm\",\n\"aperture\": \"f/2.8\",\n\"iso\": \"100-400\",\n\"shutter_speed\": \"high\",\n\"camera_height\": \"eye level\",\n\"camera_angle\": \"straight-on\",\n\"perspective\": \"natural\",\n\"distortion\": \"minimal\",\n\"optical_rendering\": \"clean natural portrait rendering\"\n},\n\n\"composition\": {\n\"orientation\": \"vertical\",\n\"aspect_ratio\": \"4:5\",\n\"framing\": \"medium close-up to upper torso\",\n\"subject_position\": \"center\",\n\"face_position\": \"upper-middle\",\n\"symmetry\": \"strong centered composition\",\n\"headroom\": \"moderate\",\n\"shoulders\": \"partially visible\",\n\"negative_space\": \"large black space surrounding subject\",\n\"background_separation\": \"extremely subtle\"\n},\n\n\"depth_of_field\": {\n\"style\": \"moderately shallow\",\n\"face\": \"tack sharp\",\n\"eyes\": \"extremely sharp\",\n\"nose\": \"sharp\",\n\"lips\": \"sharp\",\n\"hair_near_face\": \"detailed\",\n\"rear_hair\": \"gradually softer\",\n\"background\": \"completely indistinguishable from black\",\n\"blur\": \"natural optical falloff\"\n},\n\n\"visual_style\": {\n\"primary\": \"high-end fine-art black-and-white portrait photography\",\n\"secondary\": [\n\"minimalist editorial photography\",\n\"dramatic chiaroscuro\",\n\"film noir portraiture\",\n\"cinematic monochrome photography\",\n\"psychological portrait photography\"\n],\n\"aesthetic\": \"timeless, elegant, mysterious and restrained\",\n\"texture\": \"subtle authentic film grain\",\n\"skin_rendering\": \"natural\",\n\"highlight_rolloff\": \"soft\",\n\"shadow_rendering\": \"deep and controlled\",\n\"finish\": \"professional fine-art photograph\"\n},\n\n\"image_quality\": {\n\"resolution\": \"ultra-high\",\n\"detail\": \"extremely high\",\n\"skin_detail\": \"natural\",\n\"hair_detail\": \"individual realistic strands\",\n\"facial_anatomy\": \"accurate\",\n\"tonal_range\": \"wide\",\n\"dynamic_range\": \"high\",\n\"sharpening\": \"natural\",\n\"hdr\": false,\n\"plastic_rendering\": false,\n\"cgi_appearance\": false\n},\n\n\"face_consistency_block\": {\n\"priority\": \"HIGHEST\",\n\"instruction\": \"The uploaded reference image defines WHO the person is. Preserve her exact recognizable facial identity across the generation. Match facial geometry, eye shape, eyebrows, nose, lips, cheekbones, jawline, chin, forehead, facial proportions and natural asymmetry. Do not redesign or beautify the face. Creative changes are allowed only for hairstyle, clothing, pose, environment, lighting, camera and artistic treatment. The underlying identity must remain consistent.\"\n},\n\n\"negative_prompt\": [\n\"different person\",\n\"identity drift\",\n\"identity change\",\n\"face morphing\",\n\"changed facial structure\",\n\"different nose\",\n\"different nose shape\",\n\"different nose bridge\",\n\"different nose tip\",\n\"different nostrils\",\n\"different eyes\",\n\"different eyebrows\",\n\"different lips\",\n\"different jawline\",\n\"different face shape\",\n\"beautified face\",\n\"altered facial proportions\",\n\"artificial symmetry\",\n\"plastic skin\",\n\"porcelain skin\",\n\"beauty filter\",\n\"airbrushed skin\",\n\"heavy makeup\",\n\"heavy contour\",\n\"heavy lipstick\",\n\"oversized eyes\",\n\"anime face\",\n\"cartoon face\",\n\"doll face\",\n\"3D render\",\n\"CGI\",\n\"artificial skin\",\n\"unrealistic anatomy\",\n\"deformed face\",\n\"distorted nose\",\n\"distorted lips\",\n\"duplicate person\",\n\"duplicate face\",\n\"blurry eyes\",\n\"blurry face\",\n\"low detail\",\n\"oversharpening\",\n\"HDR\",\n\"color image\",\n\"colored lighting\",\n\"warm tint\",\n\"blue tint\",\n\"sepia\",\n\"busy background\",\n\"objects\",\n\"furniture\",\n\"studio equipment\",\n\"text\",\n\"logo\",\n\"watermark\",\n\"multiple light sources\",\n\"frontal flash\",\n\"flat lighting\",\n\"excessive rim light\",\n\"glowing outline\",\n\"excessive hair volume\",\n\"curly hair\",\n\"exaggerated hairstyle\",\n\"smiling\",\n\"open mouth\",\n\"head tilt\",\n\"three-quarter view\",\n\"side profile\",\n\"wide-angle distortion\",\n\"fisheye\",\n\"overexposure\",\n\"loss of facial detail\"\n]\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUFG7JsaQAAc7yH.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUFG7JsaUAAVK7S.jpg"]},{"i":19174,"text":"Create a visually stunning minimalist colored-pencil and wax-crayon artwork of [CITY], where the entire city is constructed from one single continuous hand-drawn line. The line begins as a tiny cultural symbol, travels through famous architecture, streets, vehicles, trees, mountains, and everyday life, gradually forming an intricate panoramic cityscape. Add unexpected pops of bright wax-crayon color between the graphite lines, visible paper texture, imperfect handmade strokes, subtle smudges, playful scale changes, and tiny hidden details that reward zooming in. Clean ivory background, sophisticated editorial poster composition, artistic but recognizable, highly detailed, contemporary viral design aesthetic. Add “[CITY]” in bold refined typography at the top.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUFLPtya4AA3miw.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUFLQqcbIAAHIOM.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUFLReCaEAAxIIt.jpg"]},{"i":19175,"text":"Create a completely original 30-second photorealistic live-action Hollywood science-fiction action sequence using the TWO SUPPLIED CHARACTER REFERENCE IMAGES as the exclusive identity references.\n\nCHARACTER 1 — SOLDIER:\n\nUse the supplied tactical soldier image as the exact visual identity reference. Preserve the skull mask, helmet, mounted equipment, headset, red tactical suit, tactical vest, pouches, gloves, weapons, protective equipment, boots, accessories, materials, proportions and silhouette. Do not redesign, replace, simplify, or reinterpret the soldier.\n\nCHARACTER 2 — ALIEN:\n\nUse the supplied alien image as the exact visual identity reference. Preserve the elongated head, enormous dark eyes, facial structure, dark textured skin, elongated neck, muscular anatomical structure, long limbs, hands, feet, proportions and silhouette. Do not redesign or humanize the alien.\n\nIMPORTANT:\n\nThe supplied images control CHARACTER APPEARANCE ONLY. Do not copy any existing video frame-by-frame. Create completely original choreography, camera movement, editing, environment, lighting and action.\n\nFORMAT:\n\n30 seconds.\n\nPhotorealistic live-action.\n\nHigh-end Hollywood science-fiction action-film production.\n\nCinematic 2.39:1 composition.\n\n24fps.\n\nRealistic motion blur.\n\nPhysically accurate lighting.\n\nRealistic inertia, gravity, momentum, collisions, weapon recoil and foot contact.\n\nNo animation, no game graphics, no concept art, no cartoon appearance.\n\nSCENE:\n\nA large abandoned industrial facility at night. Dark concrete floor, distant structural pillars, subtle metallic machinery, faint airborne dust, light atmospheric haze. Warm practical industrial lights mix with cool moonlight entering through damaged openings. The environment feels physically real and large-scale.\n\nBoth characters are standing approximately 8–10 meters apart.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\n0–4 SECONDS — TENSION / ESTABLISHING\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nBegin with a dramatic wide cinematic establishing shot.\n\nThe soldier stands in the foreground, weapon held low but ready.\n\nThe alien stands several meters away in the darkness.\n\nWind and subtle atmospheric movement disturb dust around their feet.\n\nThe camera slowly moves laterally while maintaining realistic parallax between foreground and background.\n\nCut to a medium close-up of the soldier.\n\nHis skull mask remains completely unchanged.\n\nHe slowly raises his weapon toward the alien.\n\nSubtle helmet equipment movement, realistic breathing motion and natural body weight.\n\nThe soldier says in a deep, controlled military voice:\n\n\"Turn back... or die.\"\n\nShort silence.\n\nThe alien slowly tilts its elongated head.\n\nIts enormous dark eyes remain fixed on the soldier.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\n4–9 SECONDS — FIRST THREAT\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nClose-up on the alien.\n\nIts facial muscles and neck move subtly.\n\nThe alien suddenly shifts its weight.\n\nIt makes one extremely fast but physically believable forward movement.\n\nThe soldier reacts immediately.\n\nCamera cuts to an over-the-shoulder shot from behind the soldier.\n\nThe alien is now significantly closer.\n\nThe soldier steps backward while maintaining his aim.\n\nHe fires a short controlled burst.\n\nREALISTIC WEAPON PHYSICS:\n\nVisible muzzle flashes.\n\nWeapon produces realistic recoil.\n\nThe soldier's shoulders react naturally to each shot.\n\nSpent casings eject according to the weapon's mechanical direction.\n\nSmoke and muzzle gases briefly appear.\n\nNo excessive explosions.\n\nNo supernatural bullet behavior.\n\nThe shots impact the environment around the alien, producing small concrete/metal fragments and dust.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\n9–15 SECONDS — ALIEN ATTACK\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nThe alien suddenly accelerates.\n\nUse a low-angle tracking shot following its movement.\n\nIts long legs push against the ground with believable force.\n\nIts body has realistic inertia.\n\nArms swing naturally to maintain balance.\n\nIt performs a sharp lateral movement rather than teleporting.\n\nThe soldier attempts to track it with the weapon.\n\nThe alien reaches the soldier's position.\n\nIt performs a rapid claw-like strike toward the weapon.\n\nThe soldier twists his torso and narrowly avoids the full impact.\n\nThe alien's movement causes the soldier's weapon to be knocked sideways.\n\nCamera performs a fast but physically motivated handheld reaction.\n\nThe soldier stumbles two steps backward.\n\nHis boots maintain realistic traction with the concrete floor.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\n15–21 SECONDS — CLOSE COMBAT\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nMedium two-character shot.\n\nThe soldier quickly recovers his stance.\n\nHe attempts a controlled defensive strike with the weapon.\n\nThe alien blocks the movement using its forearm.\n\nThe impact produces realistic body movement and momentum.\n\nThe soldier's upper body moves backward from the collision.\n\nThe alien follows with a fast horizontal strike.\n\nThe soldier ducks beneath it.\n\nThe alien's arm passes through the space above the soldier's helmet.\n\nCamera moves dynamically around them while maintaining spatial continuity.\n\nNo impossible floating movements.\n\nNo teleportation.\n\nNo rubber-like limbs.\n\nNo exaggerated superhero physics.\n\nBoth characters remain grounded and obey realistic weight, momentum and collision physics.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\n21–26 SECONDS — FINAL ESCALATION\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nThe soldier creates distance.\n\nHe raises the weapon again.\n\nExtreme close-up on his gloved finger moving onto the trigger.\n\nCut to the alien's face.\n\nIts eyes remain completely fixed on the soldier.\n\nThe soldier fires another short burst.\n\nThe alien rapidly moves sideways behind a large industrial structure.\n\nBullets strike the metal structure instead.\n\nRealistic sparks, dust and small fragments appear.\n\nThe soldier realizes the alien has disappeared from his direct line of sight.\n\nSilence for a brief moment.\n\nOnly distant machinery and the soldier's breathing can be heard.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\n26–30 SECONDS — ORIGINAL FINAL MOMENT\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nSlow cinematic push-in toward the soldier.\n\nHe carefully scans the dark environment.\n\nSuddenly the alien appears behind him at a believable distance, partially obscured by atmospheric haze.\n\nDo NOT make it teleport.\n\nShow the alien physically emerging from behind the structure.\n\nThe soldier slowly turns.\n\nCut between their faces.\n\nBoth characters stare directly at each other.\n\nThe alien makes one sudden aggressive forward movement.\n\nThe soldier raises his weapon defensively.\n\nCUT TO BLACK immediately before the physical impact.\n\nAdd a deep cinematic impact sound.\n\nEnd.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nDIALOGUE\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nSOLDIER:\n\n\"Turn back... or die.\"\n\nKeep the dialogue natural, restrained and serious.\n\nNo unnecessary dialogue.\n\nNo comedic delivery.\n\nNo exaggerated shouting.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nCAMERA / CINEMATOGRAPHY\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nUse completely original Hollywood cinematography:\n\n- large-scale establishing shot\n\n- slow lateral tracking\n\n- cinematic medium shots\n\n- low-angle alien movement shot\n\n- soldier over-the-shoulder shot\n\n- controlled handheld combat camera\n\n- close-up reaction shots\n\n- dynamic but readable combat coverage\n\n- low-angle tracking movement\n\n- subtle push-ins\n\n- shallow depth of field during emotional moments\n\n- wider lenses during physical action\n\n- longer-lens close-ups for tension\n\n- realistic camera inertia\n\n- realistic focus pulls\n\n- physically motivated camera movement\n\nMaintain clear geography between the characters at all times.\n\nDo not randomly rotate the camera.\n\nDo not use impossible camera movements.\n\nDo not copy the cinematography of any reference video.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nWEAPON / ACTION PHYSICS\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nAll weapons must behave realistically.\n\nEvery shot produces believable recoil.\n\nMuzzle flash lasts only a fraction of a second.\n\nCasings eject naturally.\n\nWeapon movement follows the soldier's hands and shoulders.\n\nThe soldier's stance changes naturally under recoil.\n\nProjectile impacts affect physical surfaces realistically.\n\nDust and debris respond to impacts and gravity.\n\nNo infinite ammunition.\n\nNo impossible recoil.\n\nNo floating objects.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2108064225273024512/img/3jAXZXzHglWaxtHE.jpg"]},{"i":19176,"text":"Premium Editorial Poster Instructions\n\nEach uploaded photo must be made into a separate, independent, premium editorial poster, and multiple photos must not be combined. Use a strict 3:4 vertical canvas. Split the canvas horizontally in the exact center: the upper half and the lower half each occupy 50% of the height, are equally wide, and equally high, with no alteration of proportion.\n\nThe upper half uses the original photo directly and must not be regenerated. Preserve the identity of the main subject, the human body or architectural structure, proportions, perspective, spatial relationships, texture, natural light and shadow, color, and environment in their entirety. Only slight cropping and restrained premium color grading are permitted; re-drawing the main subject, fictional light, HDR, excessive saturation, plastic texture, and fictional content are prohibited. When needing to adapt to the frame, only environmental areas such as sky, water surface, ground, walls, plants, or background can be extended.\n\nThe lower half extracts and reconstructs the \"narrative core\" of the photo: it can be a single primary subject, or a group of related elements that together embody the photo's identity, scale, action, o story relationship. Maintain its realistic, recognizable appearance, proportion, internal structure, texture, and relative position. Do not remove important related elements, and do not directly use rectangular photo cutouts. The reconstructed subject typically occupies 55%-80% of the width of the lower area. It should naturally extend based on the photo's primary direction and retain plausible ground, water lines, shadows, or softly dissipated edges to integrate into the background, avoiding a sticker-like or floating appearance.\n\nIncorporate a narrow, low-saturation geometric color field behind or through the center of the subject, serving as a \"critical window\" between reality and editorial abstraction. The color of the window must be extracted from the original photo, and its orientation (horizontal, vertical, or diagonal) chosen based on the overall narrative direction.\n\nThe subject must actively pass through the window: part of it is within the color field, and part enters the open negative space, naturally crossing the window's boundary to create occlusion, penetration, and spatial depth. The window is not a frame or a card; it must not fully enclose the subject. Only one primary window is allowed; multiple color blocks, thick borders, rounded corners, strong gradients, and drop shadows are prohibited.\n\nUse a white, cool white, very light gray, or near-white background for the lower half, coordinated with the photo. Employ a restrained asymmetrical composition and abundant negative space to establish a three-tier hierarchy:\n\nReconstructed subject or narrative composition\n\nLow-saturation geometric window","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUFqFlRaQAAS1jU.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUFqGvPb0AA6F9D.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUFqHY8bQAAS5n2.jpg"]},{"i":19177,"text":"（欢迎返图）：\n主题方向：东方禅意极简封面海报\n风格分支：女性审美新中式型\n主体内容：一位古风女子站在层叠台面之间，手扶一处低矮栏缘\n情绪母题：雅致、从容、清爽高级感\n场景与意象：墨绿色拱形背景结构、米白台面、女子、少量植物剪影\n构图与空间：9:16竖版构图，拱形结构位于中上部，层叠台面在下半部分形成纵深，人物位于中下部偏一侧，上方留出整洁标题区\n色彩控制：米白作为整体基底，墨绿用于拱形背景和少量植物剪影，浅金只用于极少局部高光，人物服装建议浅米白或浅豆绿白；避免整图发绿\n光线与质感：明亮柔光，结构干净，轮廓清晰，现代新中式平面海报感\n画幅比例：9:16\n补充要求：拱形结构要简洁利落，层级关系清楚，整体高级、清爽，适合高传播封面，画面留白处配上合适的文字","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HULgmahbEAAmlrT.jpg"]},{"i":19178,"text":"=Q+only relevant material constraints. Concurrent independent calls where supported; persist outputs+source-coordinate boxes+prompts immediately.\n\nP1: S→3×3 cores; pad each side20% core dimension, clip to S→9 overlapping C→E→register/blend→M1; resize assembled M1 to L.\nP2: M1→4–8 padded salient ROIs(face/hair/hands/objects/textiles as present)→E→register/blend→M2. Exclude low-information regions.\nN=3: M2→4–8 tighter focal ROIs(individual eyes/lips/nose/fingers/material details as present)→E→register/blend→M3. Keep homologous features consistent. Every E receives S, never crop alone.\n\nQ=\"1=original: identity/anatomy/color/light authority. 2=target: return exact crop/framing/geometry. Reconstruct plausible photographic detail; preserve expression, pose, contours, clothing, genuine imperfections, focus falloff. Optical clarity; natural edge transitions; spatially varied texture. Repair inherited artifacts. Skin: irregular pores/fine creases, quiet intervals. Hair: cohesive groups, selective fibers, natural sparse fringe. Iris: source color, irregular branching fibers, coherent pupil, restrained reflections. Textiles: original weave direction/spacing/motifs. Avoid invented structures/marks, beautification, relighting, halos, ringing, embossed/crosshatched/repeated texture, synthetic grain, blanket sharpening.\"\n\nASSEMBLE: map recorded boxes→master; global similarity registration first; bounded smooth local correction only with reliable correspondence, never distort rigid geometry/repeating patterns. Unreliable→retain prior pixels. Match broad exposure/color without transferring old fine texture. Normalized overlap/multiband blend; feather15–25% border→alpha0 at interior patch boundaries. Preserve native enhanced crops. Before next pass: inspect full image+100% focal/overlap crops; repair doubling/seams/drift/texture mismatch. ≤2 targeted retries/defect; rejected/failed→retain prior content+disclose.\n\nEXPORT: M_N→lossless PNG at L; verify dimensions+decode; deliver file+preview+prompts/settings. Describe detail as reconstructed; distinguish exported resolution from native generated resolution.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUGMKUXbwAE7yQ3.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2107708869455532032/img/SlNg1jk3ZSJSPelR.jpg"]},{"i":19179,"text":"4. Generate\n5. Prompt \nPrompt: Photorealistic cinematic travel portrait of a handsome young Indian man sitting casually on a lush green grassy cliff beside a calm ocean at golden hour. He is wearing a clean white oversized hoodie, relaxed-fit blue jeans, white sneakers, and a black wristwatch. One knee is raised, one hand resting naturally on his knee while the other hand runs through his slightly tousled dark hair. He looks directly at the camera with a soft, confident, relaxed expression. Behind him, shimmering ocean water reflects the warm golden sunlight, with dramatic hazy mountains across the horizon and a small green island in the distance. A leafy coastal plant with tiny purple flowers is visible in the foreground on the right. Warm sunset backlighting, glowing sun rays, natural skin texture, shallow depth of field, realistic fabric details, cinematic color grading, soft bokeh, professional travel photography, 85mm lens look, high dynamic range, ultra-detailed, natural composition, vertical portrait, 4:5 aspect ratio.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUGhfShasAA2XWX.jpg"]},{"i":19180,"text":"to video:\nOil painting style, thick impasto texture with visible palette knife strokes. Autumn landscape at sunrise with a soft orange sun rising through misty clouds. Golden-orange field with tall grass and small white wildflowers swaying gently in the wind. A vibrant orange tree on the right with leaves falling slowly in the breeze. Dark pine forest silhouette on the left covered in morning fog. Mist rolling slowly across the meadow. Warm peach and orange sky with textured white clouds drifting. Peaceful melancholic autumn atmosphere, cinematic lighting, 4k, highly detailed.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2108145791025950720/img/_pxVw_TDdPpGUIAM.jpg"]},{"i":19181,"text":"A full-body portrait of a young woman, using my uploaded photo as an absolute face reference to perfectly preserve my facial features, identity, and bone structure. She is walking confidently forward, wearing a stylish, oversized dark emerald green pantsuit with wide-leg trousers and a matching blazer over a black top. She is wearing thin, round eyeglasses and a silver wristwatch. Her long, dark brown hair flows dynamically as she moves. She is surrounded by swirling, magical golden light trails that wrap around her body. A glowing halo or burst of light radiates from behind her head. The background is a cosmic expanse filled with deep purple nebula clouds, stardust, and abstract magical energy. Dynamic pose, cinematic and heroic lighting, hyper-detailed, 8k resolution.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUHZIpOXsAAHiBE.jpg"]},{"i":19182,"text":"（欢迎返图）：\n摄影风格：日间清亮高光CCD生活照风\n写真方向：都市通勤生活写真\n场景方向：现代地铁站玻璃入口 / 弧形透明雨棚 / 银灰扶梯 / 浅色广场 / 城市写字楼\n服装方向：晴空蓝色修身U领短袖针织上衣 + 奶油白低腰修身超短裤\n气质标签：清爽、明亮、都市、自然、利落\n五官方向：清透初恋感自然脸\n身形方向：轻盈纤细\n线条强调：强\n镜头方向：半身到大腿\n姿态动作：刚从地铁入口走上广场，一只手拿小包，另一只手整理被风吹起的头发，侧前方看镜头\n光线氛围：晴天自然光 + 玻璃雨棚与银灰金属形成清亮反射补光\n滤镜效果：高亮清晰蓝白CCD色彩 + 干净白色高光 + 白皙肤色 + 清楚中间调 + 轻颗粒\n画幅比例：9:16\n补充要求：蓝色明快通透，不偏灰蓝；人物像真实周末出行抓拍，不要地铁广告感；U领自然表现胸线和肩颈","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HURV8Sea8AE4GnL.jpg"]},{"i":19183,"text":"and all images were generated with the highest quality settings.\n\nPrompt：Ultra-realistic cinematic portrait: an elderly Asian ceramic artist sitting in a cluttered studio, hands covered in wet clay, shaping a slender-necked vase on a potter's wheel; afternoon sunlight streams through a dusty window, creating Tyndall rays; wooden shelves filled with unglazed pottery, an old apron hanging on the wall; shallow depth of field, 85mm lens, visible skin pores and clay texture, warm tones, natural light, highly detailed.\n\n#openai #nanobanana","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUHS_mCbEAApMrK.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUHTB7QbAAAhh3z.jpg"]},{"i":19184,"text":"是个大工程啊\n\n摄影写真照：至少画面不脏\n\n提示词：\n3:4 竖幅人像照片。一位深色长发女生站在画面中央，微微低头直视镜头，露出自然的闭唇笑容。蓬松的刘海和长发有轻微飘动，面部柔和清晰，肤色干净自然。她穿白色短款斜领上衣，松松披着深蓝色牛仔外套，一侧肩颈露出；双手在胸腹前握着银色小型数码相机，镜头朝向观者，细挂绳自然垂下。身后是深色玻璃立面，下方有整齐的横向纹理；玻璃上的白色亮带与暖黄、橙红色灯光形成平滑的横向拖影。清晰的笑脸和相机是视觉焦点，背景柔和虚化。整体成像清透、细腻，暗部颜色纯净、层次分明，没有噪点、彩色颗粒、脏灰、灰雾或污渍；不添加胶片颗粒和旧照片滤镜。\n\n我不知道为什么用滤镜 会导致画面超级脏","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUHWuNIaoAEKw2T.jpg"]},{"i":19185,"text":"并不对应唯一画面，每次可能重新决定人物五官、凤冠结构、服装刺绣、构图、光线和背景。\n尤其你的提示词包含大量审美描述，例如：\nethereal Chinese imperial opera goddess\nChinese mysticism meets European Rococo\nOld Master painting color harmony\nmuseum-quality visual aesthetics\n这些描述允许很大的视觉发挥空间。\n2，参考图片与纯文字生成不同\n这是很重要的一点。\n如果别人使用了参考图、已有图片继续编辑，或者在同一个对话里多次调整，那么即使最后展示的提示词与你一样，也不代表生成条件相同。\n纯文字生成无法保证还原别人的具体作品。\n3，对话上下文会影响结果\n你在同一个聊天中连续生成过大量古风人像、珠宝、凤冠、服装作品。\n图片生成可能结合当前对话里的参考图片和上下文来理解你的要求，而别人可能是在全新对话中生成。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUHpBcNaEAAK78l.jpg"]},{"i":19186,"text":"一张自然随性的海边日落人像照片，3:4竖幅。一位东亚女性蹲在画面左下方的潮湿沙滩边，身体和露出的背部侧向画面右侧，双膝弯起，手自然落在膝腿附近；她把头转向镜头，眼睛看向镜头，带着轻柔的闭唇微笑。人物从头部到弯曲的膝腿占据左侧前景，裙摆和腿部在画面下缘自然裁切，右侧留出暗色海面，上方保留大片天空。头部靠近海平线，人物与远景保持明显的前后距离。\n她有深棕色长发和自然侧分的刘海，长发沿肩前垂落，发侧点缀一枚浅青绿色小饰物，深色太阳镜架在头顶。面部轮廓柔和，下颌向短而圆润的下巴自然收拢；眉眼清秀，双眼微弯，鼻部小巧，嘴角轻轻上扬，唇色柔和。穿浅蓝灰色、轻薄而略带褶皱的露背连衣裙，肩背与近侧手臂露出，身侧垂着一只金棕色编织质感小包，细肩带从肩部向下延伸。\n天空占据画面上半部：顶部是深紫灰和炭黑色厚云，云层向地平线逐渐打开；海平线上方铺展开橙红色晚霞，中间有明亮的金黄色光带和层叠的细云。海面呈深棕黑色，承接断续、细碎的橙铜色反光；地平线上仅有稀疏而很小的人影与船形剪影。近岸的浅浪从人物身后向画面右下方斜伸，前景沙滩保持深暗。\n人物脸部、肩膀和近侧手臂呈现近镜头方向局部补光的明亮效果，五官可辨、肤色偏浅而自然；黑发、裙子的背光褶皱、近岸沙滩和海面仍保留深暗层次。晚霞的暖光主要留在天空亮带与水面反射中，不把整片沙滩或人物背部均匀照亮。人物面部是最清楚的视觉中心，衣料与包身保留适度形状和质感，远处剪影只需细小轮廓，暗处不增加密集纹理。保持随手拍摄的真实照片观感、原有明暗关系和3:4构图，避免全图锐化与过度磨皮。\n----------------------------------------------------------\n我貌似觉得一味的追求真实的皮肤纹理 会让GPT加更多的噪点，果然类似 “奶油肌”这种肌肤纹理更适合","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUHuYyYbwAAqYW7.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUHuZ7tbEAE5ny_.jpg"]},{"i":19187,"text":"Theme: Kintsugi tea bowl repair Chinese title: 金缮成器 English title: GOLDEN SEAM Initial state / material: A cracked celadon tea bowl split into two pieces, cool gray-green glaze, visible raw clay fracture edges Transformation process: Fine gold lacquer seams being brushed along the cracks, tiny gold dust catching light Completed state: The same celadon bowl fully restored with luminous gold kintsugi lines, upright on a linen mat Central change axis: The gold lacquer repair seam itself — wet gold meeting clay fracture Correspondence: Crack / seam Main colors: celadon green, warm gold, ivory paper, soft charcoal Accent colors: muted rust Research node: PROCESS · SEAM · GLAZE Aspect ratio: 9:16\n\nGenerate a mature cultural exhibition poster with strong material expression and a craft-transformation central-axis composition.\n\nThe core is not two unrelated objects side by side — the material change itself becomes the composition.\n\nLeft side shows the INITIAL cracked celadon tea bowl pieces. Right side shows the COMPLETED gold-repaired bowl. Center is the critical craft moment where gold lacquer fills the fracture.\n\nViewers must understand without reading: original material → craft happening → finished state.\n\nLeft and right must truly belong together: the same bowl form, matching fracture edges that could rejoin, identical celadon glaze language.\n\nThe central axis is not a plain color band — it is where transformation occurs (gold lacquer meeting clay). Add 2–3 extremely restrained correspondence lines or process marks, never a process PPT.\n\nMaterials must read real: celadon glaze, raw clay, gold lacquer, linen, paper — clear stable surface logic. Do not replace material detail with noise or heavy aging.\n\nTypography relates to the craft logic and may cross materials, sit near the central seam, or lightly intersect the subject. Avoid fixed four-character vertical stacks or one giant central character every time.\n\nInclude one small research node totaling about 6% of the frame (PROCESS / SEAM / GLAZE).\n\nFirst glance: material contrast. Second: the central repair happening. Third: why left and right are one craft process.\n\nMuseum Exhibition Poster × Contemporary Editorial Graphic Design × East Asian Cultural Visual. High clarity, clean structure, concentrated information.\n\nAvoid: unrelated left/right content, broken process logic, plastic materials, random cracks, excessive flame, complex tool diagrams, too many technical parameters, mechanical three-column layout, PPT info boxes, heavy aging, low-finish AI poster look.\n\n—\n\nInspired by Larus","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUJ7elLaEAABd1u.jpg"]},{"i":19188,"text":"得到的是一张独立的浮雕感图片。今天配图里的上下对比，仅用于展示变化。\n\n🎯核心提示词\n将上传照片转化为一张盲压浮雕感图像，保持原图画幅、取景、主体数量、身份特征、姿态和相对位置。先把照片概括为清楚的外轮廓、主要体块与必要结构线，再把这些形状压印在一整张【纸色】厚棉纸上。主体与背景完全同色，不保留照片原来的色彩；整张纸面连续，图像由浅浅的压凸和压凹构成，凸起顶面平缓，边缘柔润，纸纤维细腻。将景深压缩为浅层起伏，背景简化为安静的纸面和少量必要轮廓，不做深洞或独立立体摆件。按主体自身结构保留辨识特征，简化细碎纹理，避免密集毛发、织物纹路和装饰抢走轮廓。左上方低角度柔和侧光掠过纸面，产生明亮边缘和右下方窄影，暗部仍可见纸纹。整体呈现精致、克制、有触感的无墨压印纸样摄影效果。仅输出转换后的单张完整图像，不做原图对比、分屏或拼贴，不加文字、边框、标志、水印，不出现剪纸叠片、石膏、陶瓷、金属、塑料或发光效果。\n\n🔁延伸玩法\n1、人像纪念\n用侧脸或半身照片，纸色选温暖象牙白。重点保留脸部轮廓、发型和姿态，背景简单一些，更容易突出人物。\n2、宠物与自然\n选轮廓完整的动物照片，试试浅鼠尾草绿。检查耳朵、四肢和身体姿态是否仍与原图对应。\n3、日常物件\n椅子、茶具都可以试。浅陶土粉或奶油黄能保留温暖纸感，把手、椅腿等关键结构要清楚。\n\n📌一句话总结\n把颜色交还给纸，让轮廓与光影留下来。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUJ-dPwbIAAofGG.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUJ-dPxbAAAOG6w.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUJ-iCBboAA1hy_.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUJ-lMvaoAAK7k0.jpg"]},{"i":19189,"text":"这套流程偏不这么干。\n\n它叫 editorial-vision-studio，是一套给 AI 图像生成用的“视觉导演”工作流。\n\n先把用途定下来，再拆画面语言、挑版面和风格，提示词排在最后才上场。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUF-UdYbkAAp6TR.png"]},{"i":19190,"text":"（欢迎返图）：\n主题方向：东方禅意极简封面海报\n风格分支：高传播清朗型\n主体内容：一位古风女子站在细长白塔下方的台面上，抬头看向塔身\n情绪母题：辽阔、向上、轻理想感\n场景与意象：细长白塔、晴空蓝天空、白色高台、女子、少量飞鸟\n构图与空间：9:16竖版构图，白塔沿画面纵向大幅拉伸形成第一视觉中心，人物位于下方偏侧，天空留出大量完整标题区\n色彩控制：纯白作为塔身和台面主基底，晴空蓝用于天空背景，少量浅灰用于结构阴影，人物服装建议浅白或淡蓝白；避免整图过冷或发灰\n光线与质感：高明度晴日光感，边缘清晰，通透平面海报感\n画幅比例：9:16\n补充要求：塔身要细长极简，形成强纵向张力，整体明亮、轻盈、有第一眼吸引力","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUQCGYbaEAA0MT7.jpg"]},{"i":19191,"text":"Use case: style-transfer\nAsset type: 竖版上下对比风格转绘海报\nPrimary request: 将输入的任意真实照片制作成一张“档案卡现场手绘记录风”的上下对比转绘图。\nInput images: 输入照片是唯一事实来源，只使用照片中的主体、姿态、数量、结构、空间关系和可确认的色彩。\nScene/backdrop: 画面为竖版约3:4比例；上半部完整保留输入照片的真实摄影质感、原始构图和自然光线，作为清晰的照片记录区；下半部变成一张米白色、略有纤维和旧纸毛边的复古档案卡。\nSubject: 不限主体，可以是人物、动物、建筑、街景、自然、交通工具、室内、食物或普通物件；从原照片提取最具识别度的主体和两三个细节，不把主题固定为船或港口。\nStyle/medium: 下半部使用黑褐色钢笔/签字笔勾线、轻微干墨擦痕、少量蜡笔或旧丝网印刷色块，像旅行档案卡、现场勘察卡、老式明信片背面的手绘观察记录；线条保留手绘抖动、局部重复描线和不完全均匀的墨色，不要做成光滑矢量插画或普通滤镜。\nComposition/framing: 下半部重新组织原照片信息，不等比例照抄原取景：把主体缩小或局部放大成档案插图，周围安排少量局部细节小框、箭头、编号、图例或材料字段；留出明确的米白呼吸空间，版面像一张完整的实体卡片。可加入一个短英文标题、一个与照片事实相关的短字段和一句极短观察，但不要大段文字。\nLighting/mood: 上半部自然真实；下半部是柔和纸面光、克制的复古记录感、安静而有观察意味。\nColor palette: 以米白、黑褐、灰蓝或暗红为基础，只从原照片提取一至两种低饱和强调色；不要套用固定黄蓝配色。\nMaterials/textures: 可见纸纤维、旧卡片边缘、轻微印刷错位、干墨断线、手写字段、细小编号和局部色块；材质必须参与构图，不能只加颗粒滤镜。\nText (verbatim): 只生成提示词明确指定的短标题/字段/观察句；若无法确认地点，不编造地名、日期、坐标、品牌、网址或长段落。\nConstraints: 上半部必须是可辨认的真实原图；下半部必须是同一照片内容的手绘档案重构；严格上下分区，不要左右并排，不要九宫格，不要多张不同照片，不要“原图/AI图”角标，不要水印；保持主体身份、数量、姿态、建筑结构、地形关系和观察角度；下半部至少改变主体尺度、裁切、信息密度或空间组织中的两项；下半部不得只是原图的同构临摹。\nAvoid: 纯调色、普通照片滤镜、3D渲染、卡通模板、无关旅游图标、凭空新增人物或地标、假中文、二维码、长段落、过度拥挤的贴纸拼贴。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT219TQaQAAFdi1.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT219TRaoAA9kqR.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT219TUbgAA2K0b.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HT219TQagAA5v4_.jpg"]},{"i":19192,"text":"库/视觉库： 帮品牌调教专属的 AI 资产，省去高昂的棚拍费用；\n\nAI 创意总监： 自己不动手画，指挥各种 AI 工具拼出整个大型项目。\n\n拥抱 AI 的创意人收入明显上涨：\n\n项目客单价上涨： 善用 AI 的创意人，承接的单个项目规模（Project size）平均增长了 40% 以上。\n\n审美与判断力更值钱： 工具门槛被 AI 抹平后，“审美水平（Taste）、独特视角（Perspective）、商业判断力（Judgment）和全局导演能力（Direction）” 变得更有溢价。能用好 AI 工具放大这些能力的人，议价空间显著高于拒绝 AI 的同行。\n\n而且还催生出的 8 大“AI 原生”全新赚钱职位：\n\n随着需求升级，客户不再只是买一张海报或剪一段视频，市场上诞生了大量全新的交付类型与岗位：\n\nAI 工作流设计（AI Workflow Design，+60.0%）： 帮团队或企业搭建基于 AI 的高效内容生产流水线。\n\nAI 创意总监（AI Creative Direction，+50.0%）： 负责把控全局审美与策略，调动各类 AI 工具统筹创意产出。\n\nAI 落地页生成（AI Landing Page Generation，+49.8%）： 借助 AI 工具快速完成高转化独立站/页面的设计与搭建。\n\n品牌图像系统构建（Brand Image Systems，+36.6%）： 用 AI 为品牌定制成套连贯的视觉图像库。\n\n创意评测与 AI 质检（Creative Evaluation & AI QA，+32.7%）： 充当专家评审，给 AI 模型生成的创意效果打标、做质量评估。\n\n品牌提示词资产包（Brand Prompt Kits，+31.8%）： 为品牌定制专用的提示词库与参数集，确保团队产出一致风格的内容。\n\nAI 原生 UGC 角色设定（AI UGC Character Design，+26.9%）： 打造数字虚拟代言人或社交内容角色。\n\n合成品牌摄影（Synthetic Brand Photography，+21.5%）： 免去高昂的实景棚拍成本，用纯 AI 打造逼真的品牌商用级静物或场景视觉。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HULpMONbwAAq-BG.jpg"]},{"i":19193,"text":"（欢迎返图）：\n9:16 竖版，古风高对比美妆封面，朱砂枫影显妆，真实摄影质感，高完成度东方古典贵女人像。\n画面主体是一位视觉年龄约 20–28 岁的年轻成年东方女性，身份为高门贵女，气质端庄、明艳、华贵、自信、矜贵。\n大半身近景构图，人物站在秋日庭院石阶前，身体基本正对镜头，略微轻侧，头部自然轻偏，肩颈舒展，一只手以自然舒展的手指轻扶胸前衣襟，另一只手放松垂落在腰侧，姿态稳定自然。她平静地看向镜头，清亮的眼神带几分从容与贵气，嘴唇微微张开。\n人物拥有明艳古典美人脸，柔和鹅蛋脸，额头饱满，面中立体丰盈，下颌线清晰流畅，修长杏眼，眼尾轻扬，眉形舒展，鼻梁秀气流畅，鼻尖精致自然，唇形丰润柔软，唇珠清晰。五官比例协调，精致耐看，具有古偶电影女主的辨识度，不幼态、不网红脸、不欧美化。\n妆容为 朱砂枫影显妆。白皙通透的自然底妆，保留细腻皮肤纹理；暖棕与胭脂粉渐层眼妆，眼尾轻微拉长，加入细腻香槟金珠光；面中和眼下有柔和明显的胭脂粉腮红，鼻尖与唇峰带精致高光；唇妆为透明红豆沙水光唇，色泽清艳饱满。整体妆面明艳、精致、通透，避免油腻感。\n乌黑长发高挽成圆润蓬松的华丽发髻，搭配朱砂红宝石花钗、浅金叶片、红玉珠串与细金长流苏。佩戴白玉圆环耳饰，搭配红珠和金色垂饰，发饰具有真实金属与玉石质感。\n服装为朱砂红金线花卉刺绣对襟上襦，内搭象牙白抹胸式精细刺绣上衣与米白长裙，腰间使用深墨青金纹织锦宽腰封和精致金属腰饰，红、白、墨青层次鲜明。人物身形丰润匀称，胸部饱满自然，胸线柔和清晰，衣料自然贴合人体，比例真实优雅。\n背景为秋日古典庭院，灰白石阶上散落橙红枫叶，木色长廊与深色廊柱纵深排列，古典灯笼与雕花石栏增加空间层次。上方与前景有少量橙红枫叶，形成自然框景，人物脸部不被遮挡。\n通透暖白日光从侧前方照亮人物，肤色白皙自然，脸部光影柔和，发丝与金饰呈现细腻金色反光。\n整体色彩为 朱砂红 + 象牙白 + 墨青 + 深木色 + 枫叶橙。服装是红色主视觉，不使用全局红色滤镜，不让肤色泛黄泛红。\n85mm 人像镜头，浅景深，面部与眼睛精准对焦，背景自然虚化，真实皮肤质感，精致织锦和刺绣纹理，电影感自然光，东方高端时尚古风画报质感，明艳华贵，高级而不俗艳。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUMpSBSa4AErTnj.jpg"]},{"i":19194,"text":"share to get you started!!\n\nA strong intense intimate close-up of a Kodiac Bear standing upright on his rear legs, looking directly at the camera mouth open in a savage roar, in a beautifully dense forest with fall colored leaves. Dramatic Caravaggio-style tenebrism. Dynamic, claustrophobic composition, windy autumn leaves motion, flowing Kodiac Bear fur, theatrical pose, intense emotion, frozen in action, explosive energy. Thick layered Kodiac Bear fur and heavy autumn leaves. In the style of Caravaggio (dark, realistic, gritty). Composition: epic scale, theatrical framing, foreshortening, cloud filtered light rays. Mood: awe-inspiring, ecstatic, majestic, intense, grandiose, cinematic, masterpiece, highly detailed, 8k, 2:3 format, octane render.\n\n🎨 Quote this post with your artwork.\n🔁 Share it so more artists can join.\n🤝 Meet new creators.\n❤️ Support each other's art.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUQ-gofWIAAHFvI.jpg"]},{"i":19195,"text":"A luxurious cowgirl portrait of myself, using my uploaded photo as a reference (GOTO), strictly maintaining my exact facial features and expressions. I am wearing an exquisite, heavily embellished blazer with a high stiff collar, completely covered in shimmering green, emerald, and gold rhinestones and crystals in mosaic patterns. Matching cowboy hat intricately decorated with the same green and gold rhinestone patterns. The background is a textured, deep emerald green velvet fabric curtain, moody studio lighting, sharp focus on the detailed crystal textures, high fashion photography.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUObYD2XkAAy05v.jpg"]},{"i":19196,"text":"{\n\"task\": \"image_generation\",\n\"style\": \"Photorealistic luxury fashion editorial, cinematic motion photography, minimalist studio campaign\",\n\"aspect_ratio\": \"4:5\",\n\"scene\": {\n\"environment\": {\n\"location\": \"Minimalist ivory-white photography studio\",\n\"background\": \"Seamless warm off-white backdrop and pale matte floor\",\n\"furniture\": \"Simple rectangular white pedestal\",\n\"atmosphere\": \"Quiet, elegant, surreal and contemporary\",\n\"color_palette\": [\"ivory\", \"cream\", \"burgundy\", \"crimson red\", \"soft gray\"]\n},\n\"main_subject\": {\n\"subject\": \"Young adult woman\",\n\"position\": \"Precisely centered in the frame\",\n\"pose\": \"Sitting upright on a rectangular white pedestal, knees naturally apart, hands resting together between her thighs, ankles crossed in front\",\n\"expression\": \"Serious, composed and confident\",\n\"gaze\": \"Direct eye contact with the camera\",\n\"hair\": {\n\"color\": \"Dark brown\",\n\"style\": \"Straight, smooth, center-parted bob ending around the jawline\",\n\"details\": \"Natural strands and subtle highlights\"\n},\n\"outfit\": {\n\"jacket\": \"Oversized ivory-white structured jacket with a high stand collar, large beige buttons and relaxed sleeves\",\n\"trousers\": \"Loose tailored cream trousers with natural fabric folds\",\n\"boots\": \"Glossy deep burgundy-red ankle boots with thick chunky platform soles\",\n\"styling\": \"Minimalist high-fashion aesthetic with no visible logos or accessories\"\n}\n},\n\"background_models\": {\n\"quantity\": \"Four to six adult figures\",\n\"action\": \"Walking briskly in different directions around the seated woman\",\n\"wardrobe\": [\n\"Vivid crimson-red outfits\",\n\"Muted burgundy clothing\",\n\"Soft gray minimalist suits\",\n\"Neutral monochrome fashion\"\n],\n\"motion_effect\": \"Pronounced horizontal and diagonal motion blur, partially cropped bodies entering and leaving the frame, indistinct faces and softly smeared silhouettes\",\n\"contrast\": \"The surrounding figures appear in motion while the central woman remains perfectly still and sharply focused\"\n}\n},\n\"composition\": {\n\"framing\": \"Full-body vertical editorial portrait\",\n\"camera_angle\": \"Straight-on, approximately seated eye level\",\n\"subject_scale\": \"Central woman occupies approximately 55 percent of image height\",\n\"symmetry\": \"Balanced central composition\",\n\"negative_space\": \"Generous clean ivory space around the subject\",\n\"foreground\": \"A blurred passing figure partially enters the lower-left edge\",\n\"background_depth\": \"Softly blurred studio environment with visible moving silhouettes\"\n},\n\"lighting\": {\n\"setup\": \"Large diffused studio light\",\n\"direction\": \"Soft frontal illumination with gentle side shadows\",\n\"quality\": \"High-key, creamy and atmospheric\",\n\"highlights\": \"Soft highlights on the jacket and glossy burgundy boots\",\n\"shadows\": \"Subtle natural contact shadows beneath the pedestal and footwear\",\n\"exposure\": \"Bright but detailed, preserving fabric texture and facial features\"\n},\n\"camera\": {\n\"type\": \"Professional full-frame camera\",\n\"lens\": \"50mm portrait lens\",\n\"aperture\": \"f/2.8\",\n\"shutter_effect\": \"Slow-shutter exposure to blur moving background figures while keeping the seated subject sharp\",\n\"focus\": \"Precise focus on the woman's face and body\",\n\"depth_of_field\": \"Shallow depth of field\",\n\"rendering\": \"Natural optical blur, realistic motion trails and subtle film grain\"\n},\n\"quality\": {\n\"resolution\": \"4K\",\n\"realism\": \"Ultra-photorealistic\",\n\"textures\": \"Detailed skin, woven fabric, polished leather and matte studio surfaces\",\n\"anatomy\": \"Natural human proportions and realistic hands\",\n\"finish\": \"Premium fashion magazine photography\"\n},\n\"negative_prompt\": [\n\"Cartoon\",\n\"Anime\",\n\"Illustration\",\n\"CGI appearance\",\n\"Plastic skin\",\n\"Over-smoothed face\",\n\"Distorted anatomy\",\n\"Extra fingers\",\n\"Malformed hands\",\n\"Duplicated central woman\",\n\"Sharp background models\",\n\"Incorrect seated pose\",\n\"Floating feet\",\n\"Deformed boots\",\n\"Incorrect clothing colors\",\n\"Overexposure\",\n\"Excessive saturation\",\n\"Busy background\",\n\"Text\",\n\"Watermark\",\n\"Logos\",\n\"Low resolution\"\n]\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUPe46qbAAA03kW.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUPe50cbUAA1xsr.jpg"]},{"i":19197,"text":"生成一张3:4竖版原创潮玩发布海报。\n唯一主体为【角色】，保留【识别特征】。\n主体完整入画，占画面高度约65%，采用【姿态】，略低机位，头部放大、身体与肢体缩短，轮廓集中圆润；幻想元素保留辨识度，末端圆钝。表情冷淡，半垂眼、小嘴，不微笑，与饱满可爱的比例形成反差。全身统一为软胶雕塑：柔和哑光表面、宽而克制的反光，服装与附属结构一体成型，无布料织纹，不像毛绒。\n主色为【配色】，只加少量深色细节。\n背景为【背景】，仅一个低矮圆形展示台，主体与背景清楚分离；左上大面积柔光，右后方细轮廓光，主体下方自然接触阴影。画面上方留白，只排中文标题“冷脸软胶”，下方只排小字“【短题】”；黑色细衬线字，精致杂志版式，手机可读，文字不遮挡主体。不出现第二个角色、现成品牌、其他文字、标志、水印、边框或拼贴。单张完整成图。\n\n示例参数：\n【角色】黑猫魔法师\n【识别特征】猫耳、金色瞳孔、圆脸、短尾、黑色尖顶帽与小披肩\n【姿态】端坐，前爪整齐并拢，尾巴绕在身侧\n【配色】墨黑与暗金\n【背景】浅奶油黄无纹理背景\n【短题】黑猫巫师\n\n🔁延伸玩法\n1、原创角色：留下发型、主色和标志性配饰，做一张IP发布海报。\n2、宠物角色：给猫或狐狸加一件能说明身份的小披风，保留原本的耳形与眼睛。\n3、系列潮玩：沿用灯光和展示台，用配色与剪影区分角色。\n\n📌一句话总结\n轮廓越圆，表情越冷，这只潮玩越有脾气。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUPevRxaoAAfL4s.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUPeyoyacAAz15e.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUPeyo7bkAAh3Or.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUPeypBboAAAdGs.jpg"]},{"i":19198,"text":"A mystical and artistic portrait of myself, using my uploaded photo as a reference (GOTO), strictly maintaining my exact facial features and expressions. I am holding a burning Ace of Spades playing card close to the camera, the card is heavily embellished with dark blue and gold jewels and crystals, with a realistic flame catching its top edge. My makeup features unique, glossy crystal-like tears streaming down my cheeks, with blue and silver glitter accents beneath my eyes. My long dark hair is adorned with delicate thin gold hair tinsel strands and a jeweled headband. The background is a textured deep blue with warm, blurry bokeh lights, cinematic and dramatic studio lighting, macro focus on the card and face.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUOboHuWAAAlaiE.jpg"]},{"i":19199,"text":"六级手绘涂鸦对比海报｜完整中文提示词\n\n请根据我上传的参考图片，生成一张单张完整的六级手绘涂鸦对比海报。\n\n最终只能输出一张合成图片，不要将原图和六张手绘图分别输出。所有内容必须放在同一张画布中。\n\n画布比例为竖版 3:4。\n\n一、整体布局\n\n将海报分为上下两个主要区域：\n\n上半部分： 原始参考图片。\n下半部分： 同一主体的六种不同绘画水平的蓝色圆珠笔手绘版本。\n\n采用干净、规整的对比布局。\n\n上半部分约占整张画布高度的45%–50%。\n下半部分约占整张画布高度的50%–55%。\n下半部分采用3列×2行网格，共6个大小相等的独立画框。\n\n最终构图为：上方一张大幅原图，下方六张逐渐变得粗糙、潦草、业余的手绘图。\n\n整个画面应当像一张清晰直观的绘画水平递减对比表，让观众一眼看出从精细素描逐渐退化成随手乱画的变化过程。\n\n二、上半部分：原始图片\n\n上半部分必须尽可能忠实地保留上传的原始图片。\n\n具体要求：\n\n保持主体身份、五官特征和外貌辨识度。\n保留原始发型、服装、姿势、表情及构图。\n保留原始图片的背景、光线、色彩氛围和材质表现。\n如果原图是真实照片，保留真实摄影质感。\n如果原图是3D角色、卡通人物或数字插画，保留其原有视觉风格。\n仅允许非常轻微的色彩优化和画面清理。\n必要时可以适当自然扩展背景，以适配海报版式。\n\n禁止美化、风格化、重新绘制、改变人物结构、拉伸或重新设计主体。\n\n上半部分应当尽可能呈现为原始参考图片本身。\n\n三、下半部分：六级蓝色圆珠笔手绘\n\n下半部分展示基于上方原图绘制的六个版本。\n\n六个画框必须表现同一个主体。\n\n统一要求：\n\n使用相同的主体身份和外貌特征。\n保持大致相同的画面取景、身体姿势和构图。\n保留发型、表情、服装轮廓以及标志性配饰。\n六个版本之间主要改变绘画完成度、线条准确性及绘画技巧水平。\n从第一级到第六级，绘画质量必须明显逐级下降。\n\n所有六张图都应采用单色蓝色或蓝紫色圆珠笔手绘风格。\n\n背景统一为略带纹理的浅米白色纸张，带有淡蓝色竖向细格线，呈现日常笔记本纸张的感觉。\n\n所有绘画都应具备真实手绘笔触，允许出现断线、重复描线、犹豫线条和自然笔迹。\n\n四、六级绘画水平与排列顺序\n\n六个画框按从左到右、从上到下的顺序排列。\n\n第一排\n\nLevel 1：精细手绘\n\n六张图中绘画水平最高、最准确的一张。\n\n主体辨识度高。\n轮廓线条相对干净。\n五官结构经过简化，但比例合理。\n保留适量头发、面部和服装细节。\n线条轻盈、稳定、控制较好。\n有一定绘画基本功。\n依然保持手绘草图感，不要达到专业精修插画或照片级效果。\n\nLevel 2：随性速写\n\n比第一级稍微简单、松散。\n\n仍然可以清楚辨认主体。\n细节比第一级更少。\n线条更加随意。\n局部比例略微不准确。\n出现少量重复描线和不均匀线条。\n带有轻微业余感。\n整体结构仍然基本正确。\n\nLevel 3：业余素描\n\n明显表现出缺乏专业绘画训练的感觉。\n\n仍然能够认出原始主体。\n五官和面部结构进一步简化。\n头身比例开始出现偏差。\n线条犹豫、不够准确。\n出现更多重复描线。\n服装细节大幅减少。\n整体像普通初学者的随手临摹作品。\n\n第二排\n\nLevel 4：粗糙涂鸦\n\n绘画质量进一步明显下降。\n\n轮廓线更加粗糙。\n大量不稳定、发抖的线条。\n五官非常简单。\n细节极少。\n头部、手臂和身体比例明显不协调。\n带有轻微滑稽感。\n看起来像随手画的业余草稿。\n依然能够大致辨认原主体。\n\nLevel 5：潦草涂鸦\n\n表现非常低水平、随意的绘画能力。\n\n线条非常粗糙。\n五官开始变成简单符号。\n头发由少量杂乱线条代替。\n眼睛、嘴巴、手臂和身体轮廓笨拙。\n服装仅保留少数辨识度较高的特征。\n形状不协调。\n几乎没有细节。\n带有一种可爱又滑稽的低水平手绘感。\n依然能隐约看出与原主体的联系。\n\nLevel 6：混乱乱画\n\n六级中最粗糙、最滑稽的一张。\n\n要求：\n\n极其简陋。\n大量混乱、不规则的随手线条。\n明显缺乏绘画技巧。\n五官位置不准确。\n头部和身体比例严重失调。\n头发变成胡乱缠绕的线团。\n眼睛、鼻子和嘴巴由少量粗糙笔迹组成。\n身体结构不完整。\n手臂和手掌画得非常笨拙。\n像完全不会画画的人随手乱涂出来的作品。\n可以非常滑稽、荒诞、粗糙，但仍要隐约保留原主体最明显的辨识特征。\n\n这一格应该是整个海报中最有趣、最具反差效果的部分。\n\n五、统一手绘风格限制\n\n下方六张图必须遵守以下共同规则：\n\n全部使用单色蓝色或蓝紫色圆珠笔线条。\n全部绘制在浅色、带有淡蓝色竖向格线的纸张上。\n具有真实的手绘笔触。\n保持相同主体身份与基本姿势。\n六张图之间主要通过线条、结构和完成度的差异进行区分。\n绘画技巧从第一张到第六张逐步下降。\n\n禁止出现以下效果：\n\n彩色绘画。\n水彩风格。\n油画风格。\n精致日漫插画。\n商业级精修插画。\n矢量线稿。\n写实光影渲染。\n过于专业的钢笔肖像画。\n过度美化的设计海报风格。\n\n尤其需要注意：第三级到第六级必须真正体现初学者和低水平绘画的区别，不能只是减少细节却依然画得非常专业。\n\n六、阴影与笔触要求\n\n整体阴影保持最低限度。\n\n尤其在第三级至第六级：\n\n避免密集交叉排线。\n避免大片深色填充。\n避免写实明暗塑造。\n避免将涂鸦画成精致钢笔插画。\n\n绘画水平越低，越应使用：\n\n简单轮廓。\n松散的乱线。\n重复描绘的线条。\n大量留白。\n笨拙的形状简化。\n明显不准确的身体结构。\n\n七、文字标签\n\n每个下方画框添加一个小型简洁标签。\n\n从左到右、从上到下分别为：\n\nLevel 1\nLevel 2\nLevel 3\nLevel 4\nLevel 5\nLevel 6\n\n标签可以放置在各画框底部居中位置。\n\n字体清楚、简洁，与蓝色圆珠笔风格协调。\n\n不要添加大型装饰标题、宣传口号或多余文字。\n\n八、最终视觉目标\n\n最终输出一张完整的竖版3:4对比海报。\n\n上半部分忠实保留原始参考图。\n\n下半部分通过3列×2行的六宫格，展示同一个主体从相对精细的手绘草图，逐渐退化成极其粗糙、滑稽、业余的乱画作品。\n\n六个版本的差异必须足够明显，形成强烈而有趣的视觉反差。\n\n所有图像主体必须保持关联性，让观众明确知道六张手绘图都来自同一张参考图片。\n\n画面结构清晰，视觉对比直观，带有幽默感，适合社交媒体分享。\n\n最终仅输出一张完整的合成海报，禁止分别输出七张图片。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUP3jf4bgAAeozb.jpg"]}];